    "70 g Weizenmehl, Typ 405",
    "0.25 Ananas",
    "1.5 Eier",
    "60 g Schokolade, Edel Bitter (ca. 80%)",
    "0.5 Orange",
    "1 Banane",
    "120 g Joghurt, natur"
